summary: Kdump test to a target by devname
description: |
    Kdump test to trigger a crash and dump to a target by devname

    Accepted Parameters:
     - MP:
       Mount point of dump device, defaulting to '/'. E.g. /mnt/data
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: make run
framework: shell
require:
  - kexec-tools
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/dump-to-devname
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/dump-to-devname
